<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela bolivar softens to 470.75/471.75/dlr.</title>
<headline>Venezuela bolivar softens to 470.75/471.75/dlr.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Venezuelan bolivar softened gently Monday to 470.75/471.75 per dollar in a day of quiet trade, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;It was a well balanced market,&quot; said one trader, who foresw much the same for Tuesday's session.</p>
<p>Brokers said that while the Central Bank monitored the market, it did not intervene.  &quot;I didn't see it during the day,&quot; said one.</p>
<p>The bolivar closed at 470.50/471.50 per dollar on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600</p>
</text>
